╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Help                                                                │
│────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
││ Navigation:                                                       │
││ ───────────────────────────────────────────                       │
││   h/l              Move between columns                           │
││   j/k              Move up/down in column                         │
││   ctrl+u / ctrl+d  Half-page scroll                               │
││   g then g/e/h/l   Jump in board                                  │
││   g then w/p/s     Jump / projects / spec                         │
││   gg/ge            Jump to top/bottom of column                   │
││   gh/gl            Jump to first/last column                      │
││                                                                   │
││ Workspace:                                                        │
││ ───────────────────────────────────────────                       │
││   Space            Open task workspace (details + actions)        │
││   Enter            Drill into epic children                       │
││                                                                   │
││ Modes:                                                            │
